OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand tells court
OL,4,Aallegations had devastating impact on
OL,5,Ahim
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand has said a documentary
OL,8,Fthat made allegations about his
OL,9,Fbehaviour had a "devastating" effect on
OL,10,Fhim, and made friends and colleagues
OL,11,Fturn against him.
OL,13,FThe entertainer has begun giving
OL,14,Fevidence as his defence case gets under
OL,15,Fway at his trial at Southwark Crown
OL,16,FCourt in London.
OL,18,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,19,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,20,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,21,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
