OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand tells court
OL,4,Aallegations had devastating impact on
OL,5,Ahim
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,8,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,9,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies all
OL,10,Fthe charges.
